1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,978
Bola api di langit Sumatra,

2
00:00:01,978 --> 00:00:03,244
Rabu malam...

3
00:00:03,244 --> 00:00:04,392
bukan meteor.

4
00:00:04,392 --> 00:00:07,428
Itu satelit NASA yang jatuh terbakar.

5
00:00:07,428 --> 00:00:10,339
Teleskop ini dirancang untuk 2 tahun...

6
00:00:10,339 --> 00:00:13,412
tapi bertahan hampir 22 tahun,

7
00:00:13,412 --> 00:00:16,281
memburu ledakan terdahsyat
di alam semesta.

8
00:00:16,281 --> 00:00:17,409
Masalahnya,

9
00:00:17,409 --> 00:00:19,347
ia tak punya mesin pendorong...

10
00:00:19,347 --> 00:00:23,036
NASA membayar 30 juta dolar
untuk robot penyelamat...

11
00:00:23,036 --> 00:00:25,163
tapi robotnya hilang kendali...

12
00:00:25,163 --> 00:00:26,775
dan malah jatuh duluan!

13
00:00:26,775 --> 00:00:28,328
Kamu sempat lihat cahayanya?

14
00:00:28,328 --> 00:00:29,936
Tulis di komentar!
